{"id":"derevnya","lemma":"деревня","pos":"noun","rank":2907,"glosses":["village, hamlet","the countryside, the rural population","yokel, bumpkin"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BD%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BD%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"деревни","plural":"деревни"},"examples":[{"text":"Он из нашей деревни.","en":"He is from our village.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null]},{"text":"Это деревня, где я родился.","en":"This is the village where I was born.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be born","l":"родиться"}]},{"text":"Они из одной деревни.","en":"They come from the same village.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"from / out of"},null,null]},{"text":"Это деревня, в которой он родился.","en":"This is the village where he was born.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be born","l":"родиться"}]},{"text":"В центре деревни стоит церковь.","en":"There's a church in the center of the village.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"center, centre","l":"центр"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},{"g":"church"}]}]}